<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #F4F6F6; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  *, *:before, *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .header {
    background: #1C2833; padding: 10pt 40pt;
    height: 40pt; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20pt; margin: 0; }
  .content {
    padding: 15pt 40pt;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-content: flex-start;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .card {
    background: #FFFFFF; border-left: 4pt solid #F1C40F;
    padding: 8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;
    /* Reduced width to ensure 2 columns fit: 720 - 80(pad) = 640. 280*2 = 560. Gap = 80. Safe. */
    width: 280pt;
    box-shadow: 2pt 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    height: 70pt;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  }
  .card h3 { color: #2C3E50; font-size: 13pt; margin: 0 0 3pt 0; font-weight: bold; }
  .card p { color: #555555; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0; line-height: 1.2; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>核心理念 (Core Principles)</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>秒懂 (Instant Understanding)</h3>
      <p>用通俗语言和生活案例解读复杂金融，让专业知识不再晦涩。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>最少必要 (Minimum Necessity)</h3>
      <p>聚焦最核心知识，摒弃冗余信息，高效掌握关键点。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>可操作 (Operability)</h3>
      <p>提供详细的实战步骤，拒绝纸上谈兵，所学即所用。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>系统化 (Systematic)</h3>
      <p>43个核心词汇构建完整认知体系，从点到面全面覆盖。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>